lisa-design:
- Subject template type is SUBJECT_TYPE_COMPONENT by decision (the release automation depends on it), even though the existing evidence also lists an inventory-item subject.
- Identity is the target label only; _issue_hash is per issue and deliberately left out of the template and label schema.
- Evidence labels (provider, intruder_type, target, _issue_hash), subjects, components and inventory are untouched, so agents that never call Init get the same evidence.
- Init uses context.Background(): the RunnerV2 Init signature carries no context (same as plugin-jira).
- The Init test asserts each template field against literals rather than a shared constructor, so a drift in main.go fails the test.
